        ex:region                "New York";
        ex:route                 "Plattsburg - Syracuse";
        dcterms:date             "1990-01-29"^^xsd:date;
        dcterms:description      "The cargo plane took off at night in snow was unable to gain altitude, make a steep descent and crashed into trees. Loss of control in-flight after the airplane stalled during climbout. The stall resulted from a loss of lift due to a contaminated wing surface. Contributing to the accident was the failure of the pilot to de-ice the aircraft prior to departure.";
        schema:location          "Plattsburg" .

