        dcterms:description      "Crashed onto a mountainside at 9,000 ft. The pilot misjudged the weather conditions and continued to fly into deteriorating weather conditions while trying to maintain VFR. The pilot attempted to climb at a speed below the minimum safe climbing speed of the aircraft.";
        schema:location          "Near Jima" .

:1967-07-06-fokker-f-27-friendship-100-id-3830
