        dcterms:description      "Crashed short of the runway on approach. Crew error. Non-compliance with proper procedure, lack of crew coordination, crew fatigue and faulty altimiter.";
        schema:location          "Bechar" .

:1983-03-30-learjet-25-id-3336
        rdf:type                 schema:Event;
