        dcterms:date             "1999-03-07"^^xsd:date;
        dcterms:description      "While approaching New Delhi Airport, the plane suddenly veered off its landing path and crashed into a building site and careened into a water tank reservoir. A witness said the plane came in very low and crashed, exploded and burned after severing power lines. A heavy layer of fog covered the area prior to the crash. The crash site was 1.5 miles from the airport.";
        schema:location          "New Delhi" .

