        ex:region                "New York";
        ex:route                 "New York City - San Francisco";
        dcterms:date             "1992-07-30"^^xsd:date;
        dcterms:description      "Immediately after liftoff, the stick shaker activated. The takeoff was aborted but the aircraft ran off the runway and caught fire. A defective stall warning system. A design flaw that allowed the defective stall warning system to go undetected. Failure of TWA's maintenance program to correct a repetitive malfunction of the stall warning system, and inadequate crew coordination between the captain and first officer that resulted in their inappropriate response to a false stall warning.";
        schema:location          "New York" .

