        dcterms:description      "The crew took the wrong plane which was scheduled for maintenance.  An in-flight fire caused the engine and then wing to separate from the aircraft and crash out of control. Tests showed a fuel pump was broken in the left engine and would spray gasoline out where it could be ignited by the exhaust. The failure of the left wing in flight as a result of damage by fire which had its source in a defective left engine driven fuel pump.";
        schema:location          "Diablo Mts." .

