        ex:route                 "Binghamton, NY - Bainbridge, NY";
        dcterms:date             "1984-12-17"^^xsd:date;
        dcterms:description      "VFR conditions prevailed when the fight departed. The destination was reported as clear until just prior to the estimated time of arrival, then fog began to form. Witnesses who heard the aircraft, just prior to the accident, reported heavy fog. After making an approach to Rwy 7, the aircraft turned to a heading of about 220 deg, then collided with trees on a wooded hill, .85 mi north of the airport. Continued VFR flight into adverse weather conditions.";
        schema:location          "Bainbridge" .

