        dcterms:description      "The cargo plane was taxiing for takeoff when a gust of wind caused the rudder to become fully defected to the left. The captain continued the takeoff despite suggestions from the crew to return to the gate. Shortly after lifting off the runway the plane yawed to the left and collided with the airport perimeter wall, bursting into flames.";
        schema:location          "Moscow" .

