        dcterms:description      "While circling around to observe a bear and her cubs the aircraft impacted trees and crashed. Failure of the pilot to maintain adequate altitude above and clearance from surrounding terrain.";
        schema:location          "Haines" .

:1943-11-19-douglas-c-47-id-1200
