        dcterms:date             "2006-05-03"^^xsd:date;
        dcterms:description      "The jetliner crashed into the Black Sea and broke up in driving rain and low visibility after making a second attempt to land. The plane disappeared from radar screens just under four miles from shore and crashed after making a turn and heading toward Adler airport for a landing. Pilot error. The pilots of the Airbus-320  allowed the plane to descend too low as it faced bad weather on its approach to the airport.";
        schema:location          "Off Sochi" .

