        dcterms:description      "While on approach to the airport, in dense fog, the aircraft descended prematurely and its left wing clipped a 30 ft. light pole on the grounds of a fire station 1.8 miles northwest of the runway threshold. The plane then veered into the adjacent elevated western embankment of a freeway and broke up, spewing flaming wreckage across all six traffilanes. Improper IFR operation. Misjudged altitude.";
        schema:location          "Santa Ana" .

