        dcterms:description      "The aircraft took off and made a low right turn, struck trees and crashed. The crew most likely lost situational awareness and as a result did not detect the increasing deviation from their intended flight path. Contributing factor was the loss of AC power to some of the flight instruments the reason for which could not be determined.";
        schema:location          "Sandy Lake" .

:2004-11-30-hbb-hfb-320-hansa-jet-id-3115
        rdf:type                 schema:Event;
