        dcterms:description      "The plane crashed while en route from Singapore to Hong Kong. Detonation of an explosive device in the passenger cabin in a suitcase under a seat. A Thai police lieutenant, accused of planting the bomb, was acquitted due to lack of sufficient evidence.";
        schema:location          "Near Pleiku" .

:1992-09-07-beechcraft-c-45h-id-2275
