:2004-08-13-convair-cv-580-id-3596
        rdf:type                 schema:Event;
        ex:aircraftType          "Convair CV-580";
        ex:groundFatalities      "0"^^xsd:int;
        ex:hour                  "00:50";
        ex:operator              "Air Taroma";
        ex:passengersAboard      "2"^^xsd:int;
        ex:passengersFatalities  "1"^^xsd:int;
        ex:region                "Ohio";
        ex:route                 "Memphis - Cincinnati";
        dcterms:date             "2004-08-13"^^xsd:date;
        dcterms:description      "While on approach at night,, the crew reported engine trouble. Shortly after the aircraft crashed on a golf course short of Runway 36R. Fuel starvation resulting from the captain's decision not to follow approved fuel crossfeed procedures. Contributing to the accident were the captain's inadequate preflight planning, his subsequent distraction during the flight, and contributing to the accident was the flightcrew's failure to monitor the fuel gauges and to recognize that the airplane's changing handling characteristics were caused by a fuel imbalance.";
        schema:location          "Cincinnati" .

:1982-12-09-fairchild-f-27j-id-1148
        rdf:type                 schema:Event;
        ex:aircraftType          "Fairchild F-27J";
        ex:groundFatalities      "0"^^xsd:int;
        ex:hour                  "13:27";
        ex:operator              "Aeronor Chile";
        ex:passengersAboard      "46"^^xsd:int;
        ex:passengersFatalities  "46"^^xsd:int;
        ex:region                "Chile";
        ex:route                 "Santiago - La Serena";
        dcterms:date             "1982-12-09"^^xsd:date;
        dcterms:description      "While on approach, the aircraft suddenly banked to the left and went into a steep descent and crashed.  Inadequate flight procedures by the pilot in command after experiencing a loss of power in the left engine.  Inadequate flight planning by the pilot-in-command in coordinating the adoption of measures and applying procedures to successfully remedy a stall condition caused by total loss of power in the left engine when the aircraft was flying at low altitude on final approach to land.";
        schema:location          "La Serena" .

