        dcterms:description      "The aircraft crashed  near Nuevo Berlin, a town on the banks of the Uruguay River, after changing its route to avoid heavy rain and hail. A crater 25 feet deep crater was created where the plane crashed into the earth.  Pitot heater failure.";
        schema:location          "Nuevo Berlin" .

